# overseer 2026-10-12: CC scratch previews (P34's town.png at 5.6 MB stalled the autopilot commit)
notes/cc-P*-tools/*.png

# cc-P91: the overnight bot's run folders keep report.md, results.json and email.txt in git (cc-P706: no transcripts); the
# shard's own logs and the build log are large and stay out (5 MB repo rule).
testing/bot-runs/*/*.log
# cc-P706: and the transcripts too. A night is 10 to 21 MB of them (soak.txt alone reached 8.5 MB on 2026-10-27, over the
# 5 MB rule, and Commit-ShardWork refused every docs merge). They stay on the game PC in the run folder, git-ignored,
# until uobot/archive.py moves them to iCloud after retentionDays; report.md, results.json and email.txt are committed.
testing/bot-runs/*/transcripts/
testing/bot-tonight.json

# cc-P141: third-party previews for the Rootdeep mockup. DRC1K and otimpyre forbid reposting, and this repo is public:
# build_mockup.py makes them on the PC that runs it, and index.html shows them only there.
notes/art/rootdeep-mockup/local-previews/
